LaTeX
description: text/x-latex - KaTeX-typeset math, as a page and as a chapter chunk
- >
  A `.tex`-flavored file (`text/x-latex`) is typeset with KaTeX. The same machinery serves
  `$$...$$` math inside [marklower](*::documents:marklower) prose, Markdown, and AsciiDoc -
  one typesetter everywhere.
- >
  As a chapter body element, a LaTeX member renders as a formula chunk in the reading flow.
